# Spec review outputs are derived files: the review gate looks for them on disk, not in the
# repository. Committing them would add a hundred kilobytes of machine output per round and
# would widen the working tree that the next review has to read.
# The pattern is deliberately directory-independent: a spec may sit beside the tool it describes
# rather than under specs/, and a directory-anchored pattern silently missed those.
*.md.review
